ary wing nasrallah also  told those on the streets they won't be  able to topple the ruling Alliance  Lebanon's political and sectarian divide  is deep but those who are raising their  voices are standing united carrying only  the Lebanese flag this is the biggest  nationwide protest in years but there is  a large number of Lebanese whose  allegiance remains with their political  parties it's unclear how much those on  the streets can achieve XANA hodor al  Jazeera Beirut
 

